  "description": "The Salsa Horsethief C frame is our carbon fiber trail bike frame built to bring you many years of memorable mountain bike adventures. With room for two full-size bottles in the triangle and top tube mounts for ride accessories, you can ditch the backpack for a streamlined setup that lets you focus on the trail. The Horsethief frame features a Split Pivot suspension design and trail geometry for impressive performance when climbing and descending. The 120 mm Fox Float DPS Performance Elite shock is supple and efficient — pair it with a 140 mm fork and your favorite components, then let fly. You can even choose between 29\" or 27.5+ wheels depending on your local terrain and riding style.",
